      "writtenOn": "2025-05-20T23:37:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This works on the brox platform because the hardware design implements the hibernate circuitry using discrete logic.  \n\nDoes the RTS5915 support a deep-sleep mode natively?  This would be a mode where most of the EC can be turned off except for a few wake input sources.\n\nDoes the RTS5915 always require the platform provide the hibernate logic?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 238,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 240,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "581f71acf5eb5c8a36b55683971757c0422f87cd",
