        "id": 3513462
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-21T08:02:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In brox we follow the original design of external hibernate logic.\n\nHowever, RTS5915 does support a deep-sleep mode (ULPM mode) which relay on vbatt to keep some wake pin (vin pin) function and those vin pin will trigger a vout to enable z power, and then ec will be powered (wake).",
